{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2020-06-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'CAESARS SAYS REVENUE FOR REOPENED NEVADA PROPERTIES FOR PERIOD THEY WERE OPERATING IN JUNE THROUGH JUNE 10 DECLINED ABOUT 56-58%', 'text': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT -REVENUE FOR REOPENED REGIONAL PROPERTIES FOR PERIOD THEY WERE OPERATING IN MAY AND/OR JUNE THROUGH JUNE 10, 2020 WERE FLAT TO UP 2%.CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT - REVENUE FOR REOPENED NEVADA PROPERTIES FOR PERIOD THEY WERE OPERATING IN JUNE THROUGH JUNE 10 DECLINED ABOUT 56-58%.CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT -ADJUSTED EBITDA FOR REOPENED NEVADA PROPERTIES FOR PERIOD THEY WERE OPERATING IN JUNE THROUGH JUNE 10, DECLINED ABOUT 70-80%.CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT - ADJUSTED EBITDA FOR REOPENED REGIONAL PROPERTIES IN MAY AND/OR JUNE THROUGH JUNE 10 INCREASED ABOUT 35% TO 40% VERSUS YEAR AGO.'}